 {
  "model": "base",
  "lang": "ha",
  "page": "10_rainfall",
  "spoken": true,
  "problems": [],
  "old_rules_spoken": true,
  "text": "Wannan shafin yana nuna matsakaicin ruwan sama na kowane wata a Legas a cikin millimeters. An bayyana adadin da aka samu ga kowace wata daga Janairu zuwa Disamba, tare da lambobi masu zuwa: January 35, February 50, March 100, April 145, May 270, June 460, July 280, August 70, September 160, October 200, November 70, da December 25.\n\nTambayar ta yi don sanin wanne watan ya fi samun ruwan sama. Don gano wannan, za mu iya kwatanta yawan ruwan sama a kowace wata. Idan muka dubi bayanan, zamu iya ganin cewa watan Yuni yana da mafi girman adadin ruwan sama (wato, mafi girma) idan aka kwatanta da sauran watanni. \n\nDon tantance bambanci tsakanin Yuni da Yuli, za mu iya rage yawan ruwan sama na Yuli daga na Yuni. Duk da haka, ba tare da takamaiman adadin ruwan sama ba ga kowace wata, ba za mu iya lissafin ainihin bambancin ba. Saboda haka, bisa ga bayanan da ke akwai, Yuni shine watan da ya fi samun ruwan sama, amma ba za mu iya tantance adadin ruwan sama na musamman tsakanin Yuni da Yuli ba.",
  "unsafe": []
 },
